This directory contains the rtm2ew 1.6.0 2016.11.08 binaries 
(rename them rtm2ew for your platform):

rtm2ew_win32.exe  - Windows32 (compiled on AMD A6 with Win 7, Visual Studio 12)
rtm2ew_win64.exe  - Windows64 (compiled on AMD A6 with Win 7, Visual Studio 12)
rtm2ew_lin32  - Linux32 (compiled on AMD A6 with Ubuntu 14.04 LTS, GCC 4.8.4)
rtm2ew_lin64  - Linux64 (compiled on AMD A6 with Ubuntu 14.04 LTS, GCC 4.8.4)
rtm2ew_mac32  - Macosx32 (compiled on MAC mini Intel with Macos 10.12 Sierra, GCC 6.20)
rtm2ew_mac64  - Macosx64 (compiled on MAC mini Intel with Macos 10.12 Sierra, GCC 6.20)
rtm2ew_cent32  - Centos32 (compiled on Intel Xeon with Centos6.8, GCC 4.4.7)
rtm2ew_cent64  - Centos64 (compiled on Intel Xeon with Centos6.8, GCC 4.4.7)

Contact Trimble to have any other Linux flavors built.
